// The forest library: what a forest scene reuses, without placing any trees, plants, ground or
// water. The state the sliders write (season, precipitation, wind, hour), the helpers, the wind
// the plants sway in, the materials and texture maps, the bark, leaves and trees (beech, oak,
// birch, spruce, fir and snag), the undergrowth (grass, ferns, flowers, shrubs, logs, stumps,
// rocks, mushrooms and litter), the boulders, the sky and the sun, and the window and the HUD
// with its sliders.
//
// A scene includes ui/widgets (the HUD uses it), then this, then places the things and sets up
// its camera and view, such as forest.flecs.
include state
include helpers
include wind
include materials
include bark
include leaves
include trees
include undergrowth
include boulders
include sky
include hud

